{"id":"W14d0e413fa5bd746938170a7","zh":"","en":"crosswind","name":"crosswind","language":"en","domain":"风作用","concept_id":"Cc507a047df61da4904f1","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中作用于运行车辆的侧向风环境或风作用。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"crosswind 也有连字符和复数形式。横风、脉动风和阵风应分别表达。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W14d0e413fa5bd746938170a7","text":"crosswind","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sfc721f74675bf8a6c465","source_id":"P011","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"en","text":"Baker [4,5] is the one of the pioneer, who conducted researches on the safety of road vehicles in sharp crosswind gusts.","citations":[{"source_id":"P011","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Scc12efbd388c0a1fb543","source_id":"P011","page":18,"page_end":18,"language":"en","text":"From Table 1, it can be known that the crosswind will directly exert effects on lateral acceleration of the car body.","citations":[{"source_id":"P011","page":18,"page_end":18}]},{"id":"S191710c5d17faaae3470","source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"en","text":"The stability and comfort of the vehicle will be significantly affected when the standard velocity of the crosswind reaches 15m/s, and the security of the vehicle will be damaged if the speed of the winds is over 25m/s.The model devel-oped in this paper can be applied to the stochastic analysis and reliability evaluation of vehicle-track systems.","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10}]}],"sources":{"P011":{"id":"P011","title":"A model for vehicle–track random interactions on effects of crosswinds and track irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1469775","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics 57 (3), 444-469","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-model-for-vehicle-track-random-interactions-on-effects-of-crosswinds-and-track-irregularities"},"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车